// The .exe's icon (Makefile: windres -I docs/icon). ID 1: Explorer and the taskbar use the first icon resource.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
// The application manifest (RT_MANIFEST 24, ID 1): UTF-8 as the process code page - a game files folder, or the
// PrimeRecomp folder, named with characters outside the system code page wasn't found (fopen and friends read paths
// in that code page; the folder dialogs give UTF-8)
1 24 "windows.manifest"
